Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ansible-core (>= 2.15) | ansible (>= 8)
Recommends: ansible-collection-community-general
Description: Ansible collection to install and manage mcprack
 The vitexsoftware.mcprack collection installs, configures and manages mcprack,
 the catalog and client-configuration portal for MCP (Model Context Protocol)
 servers.
 .
 It provides the vitexsoftware.mcprack.app role (package, /etc/mcprack/env,
 nginx front end, administrators, catalog entries) and modules that wrap the
 mcprack command line: mcprack_server, mcprack_user, mcprack_user_access,
 mcprack_user_selection, mcprack_user_override, mcprack_user_config,
 mcprack_secret, mcprack_template and mcprack_template_apply.
